{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 62, :comments ["ויצחק בא מבוא — like: באכה סדומה. And Yitzhak, on that day that the servant came, came from be'er-lechai-ro'i." "For Yitzhak dwells in the land of the Negev, where be'er lechai ro'i is, as written: על העין בדרך שור. And written: ויסע משם אברהם ארצה הנגב וישב בין קדש ובין שור. And since on that day he came from there, he did not know what his workers were doing. And they were planting gardens and orchards."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:45:04.743087846Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}